  "body": "When we previously used Sydent to validate email at registration and redirect to the client, Sydent would append the `sid` value to the `next_link` so the client will have this without storing any state.\r\n\r\nNow that Synapse sends email validation itself, we need it to do the same thing as well. Without this, it prevent Riot Web from continuing through the registration flow.",
